# AGENTS.md holds the repo guidance and is tracked; CLAUDE.md is the one-line
# import that makes Claude Code load it (Claude Code does not read AGENTS.md).
# Personal, machine-local guidance goes in CLAUDE.local.md, covered by *.local.md.

